{
  "facts": [
    {
      "topic": "scope",
      "statement": "The fuzz entry’s primary operation is md_html on the bytes remaining after two unsigned input words. Those words supply parser_flags and renderer_flags.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-1056c6fa42072a012709",
          "start_line": 15,
          "end_line": 29,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "Inputs shorter than two unsigned words return before md_html is called. The build recipe compiles this entry and links the HTML renderer and parser libraries.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-1056c6fa42072a012709",
          "start_line": 18,
          "end_line": 29,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9425ff77c711ce4cae9b",
          "start_line": 21,
          "end_line": 26,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Identifies the compiled fuzz entry and linked libraries."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "The after source defines MD_FLAG_SPOILERS as 0x10000 and specifies ||hidden text|| as a spoiler span recognized only with that flag.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-48a51db95f89128f1fd3",
          "start_line": 325,
          "end_line": 326,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-aea6042884a3262bb813",
          "start_line": 150,
          "end_line": 154,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "A finite input can put 0x10000 in the first unsigned word and ||text|| after the two flag words. md_html copies parser_flags into its parser, installs the HTML span callbacks, and calls md_parse.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-1056c6fa42072a012709",
          "start_line": 18,
          "end_line": 29,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-48a51db95f89128f1fd3",
          "start_line": 326,
          "end_line": 326,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Gives the bit value selectable in the first input word."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-f24f5788def8fdb4785a",
          "start_line": 533,
          "end_line": 551,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows how md_html passes parser flags and installs the rendering callbacks."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-f24f5788def8fdb4785a",
          "start_line": 573,
          "end_line": 574,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the call from md_html to md_parse."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "trigger",
      "statement": "With MD_FLAG_SPOILERS set, the parser marks pipe characters for scanning and collects each adjacent double pipe as one potential opener and closer mark.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-d10449ef4533980fa761",
          "start_line": 2755,
          "end_line": 2757,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-e3390cb39a4acb4ce516",
          "start_line": 3284,
          "end_line": 3293,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows collection of double-pipe marks once pipes are scanned."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "Outside table mode, inline analysis calls md_analyze_link_contents. With the spoiler flag set, that helper sends unresolved double-pipe marks to md_analyze_pipe, which pairs a potential closer with a pending opener and resolves their range.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9854f259ba7c0191d3ec",
          "start_line": 4144,
          "end_line": 4158,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-fbbe6bfc649369919054",
          "start_line": 4170,
          "end_line": 4181,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the flag gate and call to the double-pipe resolver."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-3e73bbc2708be8760b6c",
          "start_line": 3854,
          "end_line": 3869,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows pairing and resolution of opener and closer marks."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "Inline processing dispatches resolved double-pipe marks as MD_SPAN_SPOILER enter and leave callbacks. The HTML callbacks emit <x-spoiler> and </x-spoiler> for those span events.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-2106c93931de3a887955",
          "start_line": 4346,
          "end_line": 4353,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-7bb4879720e3cda5d58e",
          "start_line": 467,
          "end_line": 470,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the opening HTML tag emitted for MD_SPAN_SPOILER."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-f24f5788def8fdb4785a",
          "start_line": 493,
          "end_line": 497,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the closing HTML tag emitted for MD_SPAN_SPOILER."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The renderer suppresses nested HTML tags inside an image label. A witness for emitted spoiler tags therefore needs a context outside an image label.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-7bb4879720e3cda5d58e",
          "start_line": 456,
          "end_line": 459,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-f24f5788def8fdb4785a",
          "start_line": 483,
          "end_line": 486,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the corresponding closing-tag suppression while image nesting remains positive."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "In table mode, md_analyze_inlines handles single-pipe cell boundaries and returns before md_analyze_link_contents. This gate limits that context; the supplied non-table call path remains available.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-9854f259ba7c0191d3ec",
          "start_line": 4144,
          "end_line": 4158,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The complete before span enum has no spoiler type. Its pipe collector creates single-pipe marks only under table mode or MD_FLAG_WIKILINKS, and its HTML span callbacks have no spoiler case.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-308233ae2a0fe3a671f4",
          "start_line": 108,
          "end_line": 149,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-30b129775bff03a2ab73",
          "start_line": 3282,
          "end_line": 3287,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the before collector’s pipe handling."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-17bc0b285f703315b960",
          "start_line": 461,
          "end_line": 475,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the complete before opening span switch."
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "u-aee1d06796643115be72",
          "start_line": 487,
          "end_line": 501,
          "role": "dependency",
          "dependency_reason": "Shows the complete before closing span switch."
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": true,
      "audited_unit_ids": [
        "u-308233ae2a0fe3a671f4",
        "u-30b129775bff03a2ab73",
        "u-17bc0b285f703315b960",
        "u-aee1d06796643115be72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The complete old harness has no assertion or check of md_html’s return value or generated output. Its output callback returns without processing the text.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-1056c6fa42072a012709",
          "start_line": 7,
          "end_line": 31,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": true,
      "audited_unit_ids": [
        "u-1056c6fa42072a012709"
      ]
    }
  ],
